*May 2022: Anna Mbachu re-elected as a Labour candidate, but sits as an independent after being expelled in April 2022<ref>{{cite news |last1=Munro |first1=Victoria |title=Waltham Forest Labour gives away seat by expelling own candidate |url=https://walthamforestecho.co.uk/2022/04/13/waltham-forest-labour-gives-away-seat-by-expelling-own-candidate/ |access-date=22 January 2026 |work=Waltham Forest Echo |date=13 April 2022}}</ref>
