*September 2025: Justin Halabi (Conservative) joins Reform<ref>{{cite news |last1=Marcelline |first1=Marco |title=Tories call for by-election after Chingford councillor jumps ship for Reform UK |url=https://walthamforestecho.co.uk/2025/09/11/tories-call-for-by-election-after-chingford-councillor-jumps-ship-for-reform-uk/ |access-date=22 January 2026 |work=Waltham Forest Echo |date=11 September 2025}}</ref>
