**Marion Fitzgerald (Conservative) and Tim James (Conservative) join Reform<ref>{{cite news |last1=Marcelline |first1=Marco |title=Two Chingford councillors defect to Reform UK |url=https://walthamforestecho.co.uk/2026/01/14/two-chingford-councillors-defect-to-reform-uk/ |access-date=22 January 2026 |work=Waltham Forest Echo |date=14 January 2026}}</ref>
